-2.  **Sample Probe Segment:** Generate random numbers `uc` (1D) and `up` (2D). Call `bssrdf.SampleSp(uc, up)` to get a `BSSRDFProbeSegment` from entry `p0` to exit `p1`. If no segment is returned, break the subsurface loop.
